# EchLub Work Packages

Use bounded packages with:

- objective, risk_tier, file_scope, semantic_scope, claim_scope
- authorized_scope, forbidden_scope, allowed_actions, forbidden_actions
- required_checks, stop_gate, model_budget_policy

Implementation completion is not approval. Diff and tests are authoritative.
